# Multiplayer on a pad: from Sort, the d-pad's left to Refresh, not a sort
# of its own, and A asks again -- test_ui_scripts.c finds the look made
# twice. The pad has no Tab: its left and right are the top row's way.
pad attach xbox
wait 2
expect home
find Multiplayer
key Return
wait 2.5
expect multiplayer
find Sort: By ping
pad button 13 down
wait 0.15
pad button 13 up
wait 0.3
pad button 0 down
wait 0.15
pad button 0 up
wait 2.5
expect multiplayer
find Back
key Return
wait 0.5
expect home
find Quit
key Return
